    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18891" root="ستهم" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُتْهُمٌ</span></b>  <i>Large in the posteriors:</i> (K:) accord. to
the S, <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْتَهُ</span>; [see this latter, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سته</span>,
in three places;] and the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span> is augmentative:
(TA:) some explain it as <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتٌ</span>: the
author of the K [a mistake for the S], in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سته</span>,
as meaning <i>large in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْت</span>. (MF, TA.)

